<wxs module="visual">function drafts(rows){var n=0;for(var i=0;i<rows.length;i++)if(rows[i].status==='DRAFT')n++;return n;}module.exports={drafts:drafts};</wxs>
<navigation-bar id="family-navigation" title="家庭食谱" back="{{false}}" color="#3d302a" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="my-nav" bindtap="goBack"><view></view></view></navigation-bar><scroll-view class="my-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="my-shell">
 <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="my-state">正在读取家庭食谱…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="my-error">{{error}}<button class="my-secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:else><view class="my-card"><view class="my-heading"><text class="my-title">家庭食谱</text><text class="my-muted">已发布候选</text></view><view wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="recipeRevisionId" class="family-dish"><image class="family-image" src="/assets/camera-food-guide-v5.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="family-copy"><text class="family-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="my-small">家庭候选 · {{item.ageLabel}} · {{item.ingredientCount}}种标准食材</text></view></view><text wx:if="{{!candidates.length}}" class="my-sub">暂无符合当前月龄的已发布食谱</text></view><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">家庭草稿</text><view wx:for="{{recipes}}" wx:key="recipeId" wx:if="{{item.status==='DRAFT'}}" class="family-draft"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="my-chip">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{!visual.drafts(recipes)}}" class="my-sub draft-empty">暂无家庭草稿</text></view></block>
 <view class="my-disclosure"><view id="family-info-toggle" class="my-disclosure-toggle" bindtap="toggleInfo"><text>功能说明</text><text>{{showInfo?'−':'+'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{showInfo}}" id="family-info-body" class="my-disclosure-body"><text class="my-sub">{{notice}}</text><text class="my-sub">{{caregiverNotice}}；候选不会自动记为实际摄入。</text><text class="my-small">{{babyName}} · {{ageText}}。家庭食谱只读展示，与AI七天菜单分开管理。</text><text wx:if="{{excludedCount}}" class="my-small">已按月龄或家庭避免食材排除{{excludedCount}}项候选。</text><view wx:if="{{recipes.length}}" class="source-list"><text class="my-field-label">全部家庭食谱</text><view wx:for="{{recipes}}" wx:key="recipeId" class="source-recipe"><text class="my-sub">{{item.name}} · {{item.statusLabel}}</text><text class="my-small">{{item.description || '暂无说明'}} · 修订{{item.revision || '—'}} · {{item.weightLabel}}</text></view></view><text class="my-field-label">家庭避免食材（非医学禁忌）</text><text wx:for="{{avoidances}}" wx:key="foodId" class="my-small">{{item.foodName}} · {{item.reason || '家庭主动避免'}}</text><text wx:if="{{!avoidances.length}}" class="my-small">当前未设置家庭避免食材</text><text class="my-small">未发布草稿不会进入候选或营养计算，候选不等于已确认摄入。</text></view></view>
</view></scroll-view>